        "temperament": "Aggressive",
        "wild": "Kaprosuchus paludentium is a fast, aggressive crocodilian that hunts on land as effectively as in water. It is notorious for its ability to leap at prey and grab riders directly from their mounts — a terrifying capability that makes it one of the most feared ambush predators in swamp regions. It strikes fast and hard before its target can react.",
